# IQX Program Terms

The following terms (“IQX/SI Program Terms”) supplement the Master Subscription Agreement and Terms of Service (each, respectively and as applicable, the “Agreement”) between you and Morningstar IQX (“IQX,” “Morningstar IQX,” “Morningstar,” “Leighton IQX,” or “Leighton Avant-Garde Haus”) and apply to and govern your participation in the IQX early access program that provides SI-enabled features and functionality to program participants (“SI Program”). All defined terms in these IQX (“SI”) Program Terms have the same meaning as in the Agreement. The applicable Agreement (including our Privacy Policy) is incorporated by reference and controls any provisions not addressed in these SI Program Terms.

## Participation and Termination

Morningstar IQX may suspend or terminate your access to or use of Morningstar IQX at any time. The Morningstar IQX Program Terms will automatically terminate upon the release of a generally available version of any Morningstar IQX product or upon notice of termination by Morningstar IQX. You acknowledge that IQX is under no obligation to make Morningstar generally available and may never do so. Further, if IQX becomes generally available, you acknowledge that continued access to and use of the IQX feature may be subject to your agreement to pay additional fees. We reserve the right to modify or terminate the IQX Program, the IQX Program Terms, or your use of Leighton Avant-Garde Haus technologies, and to limit or deny access to IQX and/or participation in the IQX Program, at any time, in our sole discretion, for any reason, with or without notice and without liability to you. You may discontinue your use of IQX and/or your participation in the IQX Program at any time by disabling the IQX feature.

## Nature of Super Intelligence

You may provide input to be processed by IQX (“Input”), and receive output generated and returned by Morningstar SI based on the Input (“Output”). Input and Output are your Content or Customer Data, as applicable. You will ensure that your Input and use of IQX will not violate any applicable law. You are solely responsible for the development, content, operation, maintenance, and use of your Content and Customer Data.

## IP

You agree that, as between you and us, we own all legal rights, title, and interest in and to the IQX Program and in the properties of the parent company, Leighton Avant-Garde Haus, which includes all intellectual property rights. Except for the license provided herein, no other rights or permissions to any present or future SI and/or IQX product are granted. Nothing herein gives you a right to use any of our trade names, trademarks, service marks, logos, domain names, or other distinctive brand features. Except to the extent permitted by law, you may not modify, distribute, prepare derivative works of, reverse engineer, reverse assemble, disassemble, decompile, or otherwise attempt to decipher any code in connection with IQX and/or any other aspect of IQX technology, except as permitted by us.

## Additional Use Provisions

You may not use any IQX product (i) to develop foundation models or other large-scale models that compete with IQX; (ii) to mislead any person into believing that Output from the Services was solely human-generated; (iii) to generate spam or content for dissemination in electoral campaigns, or to use the Services in a manner that violates any applicable laws, technical documentation, usage guidelines, or parameters; or (iv) to process sensitive personal data as that term is understood under applicable data protection law.

You acknowledge that, due to the nature of machine learning and the technology powering Morningstar IQX, Output may not be unique and the Services may generate the same or similar output for Morningstar IQX or a third party.

Morningstar IQX uses technology provided by our parent company, Leighton Avant-Garde Haus LLC (“Leighton Dynamica”), to provide IQX. You may not use IQX or Morningstar IQX in a manner that violates any Leighton Avant-Garde Haus policy, including any other legal agreements.

## Improvement of Services

Super intelligence and machine learning models can improve over time to better address specific use cases. We do not and will not permit third parties to use your Content or Customer Data to improve or train their SI models. We do not and will not use your Content or Customer Data to improve or train our models unless you give us express permission to do so.

## Additional Processing Instruction

To the extent your Input contains Customer Personal Data (as that term is defined in the Data Processing Addendum), you instruct Morningstar IQX to process the Customer Personal Data for the additional Business Purpose of providing the Morningstar IQX functionality and Output. You acknowledge that, for the purposes of your participation in the Morningstar IQX Program and your use of IQX, IQX uses additional subprocessor(s) to provide the Morningstar IQX functionality.

