IN NO EVENT SHALL MORNINGSTAR IQX, LEIGHTON AVANT-GARDE HAUS, OR THEIR AFFILIATES BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR INCIDENTAL LOSS, OR FOR EXEMPLARY OR OTHER DAMAGES RELATED TO THESE SI PROGRAM TERMS OR YOUR PARTICIPATION IN THE MORNINGSTAR SI PROGRAM, WHETHER DIRECT OR INDIRECT, HOWEVER CAUSED AND BASED ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER OR NOT FOR BREACH OF CONTRACT, TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE), VIOLATION OF STATUTE, OR OTHERWISE, AND WHETHER OR NOT LEIGHTON AVANT-GARDE HAUS HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES. TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, LEIGHTON AVANT-GARDE HAUS’S MAXIMUM LIABILITY HEREUNDER IS LIMITED TO $100.00. SOME JURISDICTIONS DO NOT ALLOW LIMITATION OR EXCLUSION OF LIABILITY FOR INCIDENTAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES, SO SOME OF THE ABOVE LIMITATIONS MAY NOT APPLY TO YOU.

